# COLDIRON OS — packages installed into the live image (chroot stage)
#
# NOTE: Bitcoin Core CLI tools come from the Debian `bitcoin-core` package
# (provides bitcoin-cli, bitcoin-tx, bitcoin-util). Upstream-tarball mode
# with manual SHA256SUMS.asc verification is on the roadmap.

# ---- vault & encryption ----
cryptsetup
age
argon2
paperkey
wipe

# ---- offline signing / wallet ----
bitcoin-core
pcscd
opensc
usbutils

# ---- QR (air-gapped PSBT transfer) ----
qrencode
zbar-tools

# ---- minimal desktop (X11 + Openbox) ----
xserver-xorg
xinit
openbox
xterm
menu
dbus-x11

# ---- Sparrow runtime deps (jpackage bundle needs GTK3) ----
libgtk-3-0

# ---- live system plumbing (installed by live-build too; explicit for clarity) ----
live-boot
live-boot-initramfs-tools
live-config
live-config-systemd
live-tools

# ---- console / locale ----
console-setup
keyboard-configuration
locales
dosfstools
parted
hdparm
gpg
